> Engraving; what takes just one turn for a whole word? (Some wands, I  
> think, and Magicbane? I vaguely remember digging and fire. Something  
> else?) Engraving in the floor can be erased with time, no? Fire stays,  
> right? (What else?)

Ten letters per turn with wands, fingers, magic markers, and uncursed
or blessed athames; one letter per turn with gems and other objects that
can engrave at all. Engraving (such as Magicbane or a wand of digging)
will vanish eventually but is much more permanent than just using your
fingers in the dust; wands of fire and lightning burn in permanently.
I believe magic marker writing has the same permanence as engraving,
but am not 100% sure.

