Ways to uncurse cursed water (not a complete list, but hopefully close):
 
 * scroll of remove curse
 * dipping in fountains (but as you've seen, that has problems)
 * put them on an altar and pray, having them converted to holy water
 * pray on an altar and get the "inventory uncurse" effect
 * cancellation 

It looks like fountain-dipping might be the only option you have right
now.  My suggestion: If you are going to dip anyway, I might just dip
the hat if you want it uncursed. Unholy water might be handy later in
the game.

Ways to clear potions in general (cursed water is sort of special):

 * cancellation (but will sometimes clear to fruit juice or oil)
 * dipping in fountains
 * swimming with them, or #dipping while underwater
 * polymorphing them until you get water (OK, that's kind of an edge
   case :)

I'm sure I'm forgetting something, and someone will step in and add to
the lists.

